{"id": "tesla-2026-09-11-007", "date": "2026-09-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": ["tesla"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Geely TT launches at $19,100 — half the price of a Tesla", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/Geely-TT.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Geely launched its new TT electric sport sedan in China, starting at 129,900 yuan (about $19,100), with 800V fast charging and LiDAR on every trim.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That price puts a 640 km sedan with next-generation charging hardware at roughly half the price of a Tesla.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-paget", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/09/11/geely-tt-electric-sedan-launch-price-xiaomi-su7/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-11-008", "date": "2026-09-11", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 37, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "New, 50-ton Volvo EC500 Electric excavator never needs charging", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/volvo-ce_ec500-excavator.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Volvo designed the 50-ton class EC500 Electric to deliver the same performance as the diesel-powered EC500 the brand’s customers know and love – but saying that is one thing. Proving it? That’s another thing, entirely.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"construction,electric-h", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/09/10/new-50-ton-volvo-ec500-electric-excavator-never-needs-charging/", "type": "rss"}]}
